{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 54, :comments ["<b>And the famine was in all the lands</b> — that is, the lands surrounding the land of Egypt. For what could the distant lands do if there was a famine as severe as this in them? Thus they said in Bereshit Rabbah (Bereshit Rabbah 90:6): in three lands — in Phoenicia and in Arabia and in Philistia."], :book :genesis, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T04:22:19.858356618Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}